<h2>What makes a useful profile</h2>

<p>A strong profile is specific. It should explain:</p>

<ul>
  <li>What your organisation produces, buys, finances or provides</li>
  <li>The grades, volumes, markets or technologies relevant to you</li>
  <li>What kind of organisation you want to meet</li>
  <li>What a successful meeting would lead to</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data and privacy</h2>

<p>Matchmaking may require information beyond the website registration form. The final platform, data controller, access rules and privacy terms will be published before profiles open.</p>
